{"3538950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KunlunWonderland", "steam_appid": 3538950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction to the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kun lun Wonderland&quot; is a multi art and multi play game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can choose a game to go through, life will last forever. You can choose it. I try to connect fantasy and reality with it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get some experience that you can't get in reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your wish and tell me what you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Currently you will play to:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple weightless first person multiplayer shooting experience. Players meet in near orbit, breaking the conventional shackles and making weightlessness a weapon. There is also the traditional first person multiplayer shooting experience (unfinished, but playable.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unfinished but already in progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, simple first person battlefield shooting experience, simple zombie shooting, dungeon walking, art scene walking, etc., please look forward to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What will be done in the future:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super giant sandbox, fully programmed scenes and NPCs, early available BCI technology test projects, and players' own in-depth learning data for fully automatic generation and operation of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The initial version of development does not represent the final quality.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development cost:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the total development cost of the game (excluding the time cost) is only the steam developer deposit (US $100?), which temporarily includes free game materials+self modeling, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q&amp;A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why should I release the game and release steam before the game is finished?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a complete game, but playability and submission are more important than completion. Games with more developers cannot reach the submission and completion stage. Submit it to give me a motivation and self realization?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I want to leave something in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction to the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kun lun Wonderland&quot; is a multi art and multi play game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can choose a game to go through, life will last forever. You can choose it. I try to connect fantasy and reality with it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get some experience that you can't get in reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your wish and tell me what you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Currently you will play to:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple weightless first person multiplayer shooting experience. Players meet in near orbit, breaking the conventional shackles and making weightlessness a weapon. There is also the traditional first person multiplayer shooting experience (unfinished, but playable.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unfinished but already in progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, simple first person battlefield shooting experience, simple zombie shooting, dungeon walking, art scene walking, etc., please look forward to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What will be done in the future:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super giant sandbox, fully programmed scenes and NPCs, early available BCI technology test projects, and players' own in-depth learning data for fully automatic generation and operation of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The initial version of development does not represent the final quality.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development cost:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the total development cost of the game (excluding the time cost) is only the steam developer deposit (US $100?), which temporarily includes free game materials+self modeling, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q&amp;A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why should I release the game and release steam before the game is finished?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a complete game, but playability and submission are more important than completion. Games with more developers cannot reach the submission and completion stage. Submit it to give me a motivation and self realization?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I want to leave something in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "《Kunlun Wonderland 》is a game with many art themes and playing methods, At present, simple and casual first person shooting is the main method. Support the way of playing make a wish and tell me what you want.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538950/b5715e096311f78ab8980f3e963d7ce5912d4b5e/header.jpg?t=1764058922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538950/019b0ab3309d0246fed3310f1456fda9b1ba4955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764058922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538950/019b0ab3309d0246fed3310f1456fda9b1ba4955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764058922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000